    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but what if there isn't \"something new\"? what if it's just darkness? you talk about it being a beginning, but to me, it feels like a slow, humiliating death. i hate the idea of my family having to watch me disappear piece by piece. it feels so much more peaceful to just... leave on my own terms, while i can still say goodbye properly. is it really so wrong to want to preserve my dignity before it's all gone?",
